== the gateway's certificate, made with x509's pieces and checked by x509
subject CN=gateway.shop.test,O=Shop Demo, issued by CN=Gateway Demo Root,O=Shop Demo
for localhost, 127.0.0.1; its chain verified for a TLS server at 127.0.0.1
== services, started on loopback and told ready
dns: ready
catalog: ready
inventory: ready
reviews: ready
== upstreams registered in DNS by RFC 2136 updates
_http._tcp.catalog.shop.internal: catalog-0 (priority 10, a port where nothing listens), catalog-1 (priority 20)
_grpc._tcp.inventory.shop.internal: inventory-1
_http._tcp.reviews.shop.internal: reviews-a and reviews-b (weights 50 and 50)
== over TLS, HTTP/1.1
ALPN chose http/1.1
GET api.shop.test/catalog/items -> 200, x-gateway-route catalog, x-cache miss, x-gateway-upstream catalog-1.shop.internal, x-gateway-attempts 2, x-ratelimit-remaining 19, 3 items
  the upstream saw: for=127.0.0.1;proto=https;host="api.shop.test"
GET api.shop.test/catalog/items -> 200, x-gateway-route catalog, x-cache hit, age 0, x-ratelimit-remaining 18, 3 items
GET api.shop.test/catalog/items/A-100 -> 200, x-gateway-route catalog, x-cache miss, x-gateway-upstream catalog-1.shop.internal, x-gateway-attempts 1, x-ratelimit-remaining 17, Desk lamp
GET api.shop.test/catalog/items/A-100 (If-None-Match) -> 304, x-gateway-route catalog, x-cache hit, age 0, x-ratelimit-remaining 16
GET api.shop.test/stock/A-100 -> 200, x-gateway-route stock, x-gateway-upstream inventory-1.shop.internal, {"sku":"A-100","count":12,"warehouse":"north"}
GET api.shop.test/nowhere -> 404, no route takes api.shop.test/nowhere
== over TLS, HTTP/2
ALPN chose h2
GET api.shop.test/catalog/items/B-200 -> 200, x-gateway-route catalog, x-cache miss, x-gateway-upstream catalog-1.shop.internal, x-gateway-attempts 1, x-ratelimit-remaining 15, Notebook
POST api.shop.test/orders -> 201, x-gateway-route orders, x-gateway-upstream catalog-1.shop.internal, x-gateway-attempts 1, x-ratelimit-remaining 1, order-1
POST api.shop.test/orders -> 201, x-gateway-route orders, x-gateway-upstream catalog-1.shop.internal, x-gateway-attempts 1, x-ratelimit-remaining 0, order-2
POST api.shop.test/orders -> 429, x-ratelimit-remaining 0, retry-after 60, the client is past the rate limit of orders: 2 requests, one more every 60000 ms
gRPC /shop.inventory.v1.Inventory/GetStock -> OK, from inventory-1.shop.internal: {"sku":"A-100","count":12,"warehouse":"north"}
gRPC /shop.inventory.v1.Inventory/WatchMovements (a stream from the server)
  message 1: {"sku":"A-100","change":20,"reason":"received","balance":20}
  message 2: {"sku":"A-100","change":-5,"reason":"sold","balance":15}
  message 3: {"sku":"A-100","change":-3,"reason":"sold","balance":12}
  end: OK after 3 messages
gRPC /shop.inventory.v1.Inventory/DeleteStock -> UNIMPLEMENTED: inventory serves no method /shop.inventory.v1.Inventory/DeleteStock: shop.inventory.v1.Inventory has no method DeleteStock
GraphQL { stock(sku: "A-100") { count warehouse } reviews(sku: "A-100") { author stars } }
  -> 200: {"data":{"stock":{"count":12,"warehouse":"north"},"reviews":[{"author":"ada","stars":5},{"author":"grace","stars":4}]}}
GraphQL { stock(sku: "A-100") { count price } }
  -> 200: {"errors":[{"message":"Cannot query field \"price\" on type \"Stock\".","locations":[{"line":1,"column":31}]}]}
